== the two merge commits' messages
Merge develop 8861e6216 into ks-1059 — the three systemTest lockfile hunks leave this PR by ancestry

This branch carried PR #934's smol-toml lock bumps (cd8509faf) as a merge so its
own push could pass preflight leg 7. #934 merged to develop on 2026-09-10 as
a1e49d151, so cd8509faf is now develop's ancestor and those three
package-lock.json hunks are no longer part of this PR's diff against develop —
nothing was edited to drop them. What remains is the ks1059 test alone.

---
Merge PR #912's round-2 head 609c44c55 into ks-1059 — the stack

The KS-1059 cell pins the `inFlight &&` half of the sim leg on the line #912
made load-bearing, so it is proven on #912's bytes. #912 is the parent; merge
order #912 then #937.

